flowchart TD
  turn[Substantive turn] --> capture[Capture<br/>tool outcomes, findings,<br/>flags, preferences, task class]
  capture --> store[(ah-rsi store<br/>append-only JSONL)]
  capture --> diagnose[Diagnose recurring failures]
  diagnose --> lesson[Short lesson candidate]
  lesson --> lint[Lint + contradiction<br/>+ support check]
  lint --> admit[Admit as trial<br/>50% injection]
  admit --> inject[Inject into matching<br/>later turns]
  inject --> compare[Compare injected<br/>against eligible control]
  compare -->|wins| promote[Promote to active]
  compare -->|loses by margin| quarantine[Quarantine]
  compare -->|inconclusive| explore[Keep exploring]
  quarantine --> retire[Retire or rollback]
  promote --> inject

  note[Fixed-evaluator rule: only lesson text is mutable.<br/>The plugin, engine, project, and evaluator stay outside the loop.]
  lesson -.-> note

  classDef step fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef store fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  classDef outcome fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef note fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#0f172a
  class turn,capture,diagnose,lesson,lint,admit,inject,compare,explore step
  class store,quarantine,retire store
  class promote outcome
  class note note
